    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>On May 4, 2025, the company announced that it signed a memorandum of understanding (MoU) with China-based ZKTeco to establish a joint factory in Saudi Arabia with capital of SAR 5.63 million.</li>\r\n\t<li>On August 20, 2025, the company announced that the project&rsquo;s company was established under the name of Noor Technology Co.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
